        <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 tracking-tight leading-tight">
          Focus on <span
            class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-cyan-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent"
            >Your Core Value</span
          >
        </h1>

        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-10">
          Tell us your business idea. We'll handle all the technical infrastructure—authentication,
          payments, communications, and everything else—while you focus on what makes your product
          unique.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
          <a
            href="/contact"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-gray-900 text-white font-semibold px-8 py-4 rounded-full hover:bg-gray-800 transition shadow-xl"
          >
            <i class="fa-solid fa-rocket"></i> Start Your Project
          </a>
          <a
            href="#services-table"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white border border-gray-200 text-gray-900 font-semibold px-8 py-4 rounded-full hover:bg-gray-50 transition shadow-lg"
          >
            <i class="fa-solid fa-list"></i> View All Services
